---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Contact Us" description="Contact information and feedback details for Easy Home Workout.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h1>Contact us</h1><p>Have a suggestion or found something that could be clearer? We welcome feedback that helps make home fitness easier to understand.</p></div></section>
  <section class="content-section"><div class="wrap" style="max-width:800px"><article class="panel"><h2>Share feedback</h2><p>A public contact email or message service has not been provided for this website yet, so we cannot receive messages through this page at this time. We will add a direct contact option here when one is available.</p><p>In the meantime, you can explore the <a class="card-link" href="/about/">About page</a> to learn about the site's mission, or browse the <a class="card-link" href="/workouts/">workout plans</a> and <a class="card-link" href="/exercises/">exercise library</a>.</p></article></div></section>
</Layout>
